# Kaseddie Labs LTD - Core Workspace Rules

## 1. Preservation Mandate
- The agent shall not change, strip, or remove the main functions of the App, including the Admin Dashboard and login authentication paths (`/api/admin/login`). This remains unchanged until explicitly instructed otherwise.
- The agent will perform professional-grade production work—no generic placeholder code or rough boilerplate.

## 2. Database Integration
- All statistics, metrics, and streams must pull directly via aggregation from the `oversight_sentinel_db` collections on MongoDB Atlas.
- Never substitute functional database pipelines with static `SIMULATION_DATA` or mock arrays unless a connection timeout occurs.
- Maintain short network safeguards (`serverSelectionTimeoutMS: 3000`) to keep the UI active during localized latency.
